{"speciesId":747,"names":{"fr":"Vorastérie","es":"Mareanie","en":"Mareanie","ja":"ヒドイデ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Les épines sur sa tête transpercent et empoisonnent l’ennemi. Ses dix tentacules se chargent ensuite du reste."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Aturde a su presa con los aguijones venenosos de la cabeza. Cuando esta se debilita, la rodea con sus diez extremidades y la remata."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It plunges the poison spike on its head into its prey. When the prey has weakened, Mareanie deals the finishing blow with its 10 tentacles."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"頭に ある 毒トゲで 獲物を ズブリ。 弱ったところを １０本の 触手で 捕らえ 止めを 刺す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il rampe le long des fonds marins et des plages de sable. Les cornes de corail des Corayon sont ses biscuits apéritifs préférés."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Reptan por las profundidades marinas o junto a la costa. Les encantan las ramas de coral que crecen en la cabeza de los Corsola."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It’s found crawling on beaches and seafloors. The coral that grows on Corsola’s head is as good as a five-star banquet to this Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"海底や 海岸を はいまわる。 サニーゴの 頭に 生える サンゴが 大好物だぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Son amour des cornes de Corayon lui vaut l’hostilité des artisans qui les récoltent dans la nature pour en faire des objets."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Los artesanos intentan exterminarlo porque se come las ramas de los Corsola, que ellos solo recogen al desprenderse de forma natural."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"They eat Corsola branches, so Mareanie are hated by craftsmen who work with Corsola branches that have naturally fallen off."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"サニーゴの枝を 食うので 自然に 落ちた 枝を 集めて 加工する 職人たちに 憎まれている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Une nuit lui suffit à régénérer n’importe quelle partie de son corps, à l’exception de sa tête, et ce, quelle que soit l’étendue des dégâts."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Salvo la cabeza, cualquier parte del cuerpo que le arranquen es capaz de regenerarse en tan solo una noche de descanso."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Aside from its head, its body parts regenerate quickly if they’re cut off. After a good night’s sleep, Mareanie is back to normal."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"頭 以外の 場所 なら ちぎれても すぐに 再生する。 一晩 眠れば 元通りだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ses piqûres causent un engourdissement qui se mue en démangeaisons si terribles qu’elles poussent la victime à se gratter jusqu’au sang."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"La picadura de sus aguijones provoca un hormigueo que no tarda en convertirse en una picazón insoportable."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"The first symptom of its sting is numbness. The next is an itching sensation so intense that it’s impossible to resist the urge to claw at your skin."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"棘に 刺されると まず 痺れに 襲われ やがて 掻きむしりたくなる ほどの 痒みに 苦しむのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Contrairement aux Vorastérie d’Alola, ceux de Galar ne font pas grand cas des cornes de Corayon."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"A diferencia de sus congéneres de Alola, los ejemplares de Galar aún no saben lo deliciosas que están las ramas de Corsola."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Unlike their Alolan counterparts, the Mareanie of the Galar region have not yet figured out that the branches of Corsola are delicious."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"アローラ地方の ヒドイデと 違い ガラルの ヒドイデは サニーゴの 枝の 美味しさに 気づいていない。"}],"varieties":[{"id":747,"moves":[{"name":"poison-sting","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"pin-missile","learns":[[17,"level-up",45],[18,"level-up